  "translation": "Na mesinja bilong Yahwe i tokim em: Long wanem as yu paitim ⟨את⟩ donki meri bilong yu tripela taim? Lukim, mi kamap long wanpela pasin bilong birua, long wanem rot i bin senis i go olsem narapela pasin pastaim long mi.",
